        "r": 303.94505970882517,
        "b": 34.3680419921875
      },
      "markdown": "| Operation Mode   | Display Board   | Remote Controller   | Note                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n|------------------|-----------------|---------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| AUTO             | For 12: For 18: |                     | Under the mode of auto operation, air conditioner will automatically select Cool or Heat operation according to room temperature. air conditioner automatically adjusts the fan speed temperature. When FAN is set to AUTO, the according to room |\n| COOL             | For 12: For 18: |                     |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n| DRY              | For 12: For 18: |                     | In DRY mode, when room temperature becomes lower than temp.setting about +35 o F,unit will run at LOW speed regardless of FAN setting. intermittently                                                                                             |\n| HEAT             | For 12: For 18: |                     |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n| FAN              | nothing         |                     | In FAN operation mode, the unit will not operate in COOL or HEAT mode but only in FAN mode ,AUTO is not available in FAN mode.And temp.setting is disabled. In FAN mode,SLEEP operation is not available.                                         |",
